The CVSS v4.0 scoring tables in scripts/cvss4_tables.py (the MacroVector lookup,
max-severity distances, and max-composed vectors) are vendored verbatim, as data,
from FIRST's official reference calculator:

    https://github.com/FIRSTdotorg/cvss-v4-calculator

They are the published CVSS v4.0 specification data and are redistributed here under
their original BSD-2-Clause license, reproduced in full below. The scoring algorithm in
scripts/score.py is an independent re-implementation of FIRST's reference algorithm and
is covered by this project's MIT license; only the vendored tables are BSD-2-Clause.

